      "id": 101,
      "options": {
        "code": { "language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "# Amazon Bedrock\n\nThis dashboard monitors **Amazon Bedrock** invocation traffic across every model in use, broken out per model via CloudWatch.\n\n**What to look at first:**\n- **Invocation Count / Invocation Latency** — request volume and average latency, per model.\n- **Token Counts by Model / Daily Total Tokens by ModelId** — input and output token usage, per model and rolled up daily, for cost attribution.\n- **InputTokenCount, OutputTokenCount** — total token usage across all models combined.\n- **Requests, grouped by input tokens** — request volume bucketed by input size.\n- **Invocation Throttles / Invocation Error Count** — throttling and client/server error rates across all models.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "13.0.2",
      "targets": [],
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Invocation Count",
      "description": "Number of Bedrock invocations, broken out per model via a CloudWatch metric-math SEARCH() expression — new models appear automatically, nothing to update here when Bedrock adds one.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "cloudwatch", "uid": "mojap-data-production-cloudwatch" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 9 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false, "axisCenteredZero": false, "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisPlacement": "auto", "barAlignment": 0, "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": { "legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false },
            "insertNulls": false, "lineInterpolation": "linear", "lineWidth": 1, "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" }, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" },
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "off" }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 80 }] },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": [], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "cloudwatch", "uid": "mojap-data-production-cloudwatch" },
          "expression": "SEARCH('{AWS/Bedrock,ModelId} MetricName=\"Invocations\"', 'Sum', 300)",
          "id": "a", "label": "", "matchExact": true, "metricEditorMode": 1, "metricQueryType": 0,
          "namespace": "AWS/Bedrock", "period": "300", "queryMode": "Metrics", "refId": "A",
          "region": "$region", "hide": false
        }
      ]
    },
